eldertongue — licensing
========================

This repository contains public documentation, client configuration samples, and an
agent skill for the eldertongue Old English dictionary MCP server. Two different
licences apply, depending on what you are using:

1. Code and configuration — MIT
2. Dictionary data and content — CC BY-SA 4.0


